## Context

Child of epic 0061. After infrastructure (0063, 0064, 0065) is in
place, run Phase 1 selection: base + composite prompt on all models
per regime, 2 reps each. Present HUMAN GATE.

## Actions

1. Delete invalid outputs from previous Phase 1 attempt
2. Run parametric regime: base + composite x ablation_parametric x 2 reps
3. Run RAG regime: base + composite x ablation_rag x 2 reps
4. Run web search regime: base + composite x ablation_websearch x 2 reps
5. Evaluate all outputs against 163-plant reference
6. Tabulate HUMAN GATE report:
   - Per model per regime: F1(base), F1(composite), ΔF1, cost, time,
     output tokens, finish reason
   - Flag models with |ΔF1| > 0.05 as "responsive"
   - Total Phase 2 cost estimate at various model counts
7. Present to user for decision

## Exit criteria
- All 3 regimes Phase 1 complete
- HUMAN GATE table presented
- User decides which models x regimes proceed to Phase 2
